# Rust / Tauri security

Read `.cursor/skills/rust-security/SKILL.md`.

## Always

- Least-privilege capabilities per window
- CSP set and tightened for new hosts
- Secrets via OS keyring / memory — never committed or sent to UI
- Parameterized SQL; scoped filesystem paths
- `cargo audit` / deny mindset for new deps

## Never

- `dangerousInsecureTransport` in prod updater
- Log tokens or device keys
- Trust the frontend for authorization
- Unreviewed remote capability URLs

## On finding a secret leak

Stop, tell the user, rotate (history matters), grep for duplicates.
